script 30 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrHertz
	"어서 오세요!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 가게 주인인\n서더 씨는 정말\n장사 수완이 좋아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"얼마나 벌어들일지\n기대되는걸."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"헤헤헤."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 40 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrHertz
	"배틀 카드 가게가\n꽤 돈이 되는\n모양이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"서더 씨는 분명\n제법 큰돈을 쌓아 뒀을 거야.\n헤헤헤."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 50 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrHertz
	"소식 들었어!\n그 프레즈라는 아이가\n무사히 돌아왔대!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"축하하는 의미로\n희귀 데이터 같은 걸\n선물해 주는 건 어때?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"헤헤헤."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
